OL,3,GNEWSAJapanese technology company to    
OL,4,Acreate 200 new jobs                    
OL,6,FOne of Japan's largest technology      
OL,7,Fcompanies is creating around 200 jobs  
OL,8,Fin a new Artificial Intelligence (AI)  
OL,9,Fcentre in Londonderry.                 
OL,11,FNTT DATA announced on Wednesday that it
OL,12,Fwas investing more than #23m to set up 
OL,13,Fa new AI centre of excellence in Derry.
OL,15,FThe company, which describes itself as 
OL,16,Fa global leader in AI, digital business
OL,17,Fand technology services, will recruit  
OL,18,F200 people on an average annual salary 
OL,19,Fof #58k to work there over the next    
OL,20,Fthree years.                           
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
